{"id":"a406ab9d156c983d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-standard-labelled-reduction.md","title":"具体归约的标准性与平行标准性","display":"df-standard-labelled-reduction — 具体归约的标准性与平行标准性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-standard-labelled-reduction","aliases":["56-df-standard-labelled-reduction"],"display":"df-standard-labelled-reduction — 具体归约的标准性与平行标准性","depends_on":["[[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"§8.5 Definitions 8.5.6,8.5.40; Lemma 8.5.43","source_printed_pages":"365,378–379","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface","source_proof_status":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-standard-labelled-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-standard-labelled-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-standard-labelled-reduction — 具体归约的标准性与平行标准性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38a37d8a0a52c221\" href=\"?note=38a37d8a0a52c221\" title=\"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction\">56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.5 Definitions 8.5.6,8.5.40; Lemma 8.5.43"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"365,378–379"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; explicit-local-interface"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-source-proof-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定正交系统；具体有限路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 与平行路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R\">\\(\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38a37d8a0a52c221\" href=\"?note=38a37d8a0a52c221\" title=\"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction\">56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\ell(\\rho)\">\\(n=\\ell(\\rho)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=L(\\Pi)\">\\(m=L(\\Pi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i=\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)\">\\(p_i=\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos},\\preceq,&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos},\\preceq,&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 见其上游，子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPat}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{VPat}_R\\)</span> 的局部参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(p,l,r)\\in\\mathcal E_R\">\\(u=(p,l,r)\\in\\mathcal E_R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i(\\rho)\">\\(J_i(\\rho)\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i&lt;n\">\\(0\\le i&lt;n\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\">\\(K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i&lt;m\">\\(0\\le i&lt;m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in U_i\">\\(u\\in U_i\\)</span> 定义。首次指标通过在候选集中量化其最小元素表达，不对空集合调用部分min函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPat}_R(u)\\coloneqq\\{p\\cdot q:q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(l)\\land l|_q\\notin V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VPat}_R(u)\\coloneqq\\{p\\cdot q:q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(l)\\land l|_q\\notin V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_i(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\{j:i&lt;j&lt;n\\land(\\operatorname{pos}(u_j)=p_i\\lor\\operatorname{pos}(u_j)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p_i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_i(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\{j:i&lt;j&lt;n\\land(\\operatorname{pos}(u_j)=p_i\\lor\\operatorname{pos}(u_j)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p_i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Std}_R(\\rho)\\iff\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\forall j\\in J_i(\\rho)\\;\\bigl((\\forall k\\in J_i(\\rho)\\;(j\\le k))\\Rightarrow p_i\\in\\operatorname{VPat}_R(u_j)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Std}_R(\\rho)\\iff\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\forall j\\in J_i(\\rho)\\;\\bigl((\\forall k\\in J_i(\\rho)\\;(j\\le k))\\Rightarrow p_i\\in\\operatorname{VPat}_R(u_j)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\{j:i&lt;j&lt;m\\land\\exists v\\in U_j\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(v)\\preceq\\operatorname{pos}(u))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\{j:i&lt;j&lt;m\\land\\exists v\\in U_j\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(v)\\preceq\\operatorname{pos}(u))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PStd}_R(\\Pi)\\iff\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\forall u\\in U_i\\;\\forall j\\in K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\;\\bigl((\\forall k\\in K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\;(j\\le k))\\Rightarrow\\exists v\\in U_j\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\in\\operatorname{VPat}_R(v))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PStd}_R(\\Pi)\\iff\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\forall u\\in U_i\\;\\forall j\\in K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\;\\bigl((\\forall k\\in K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\;(j\\le k))\\Rightarrow\\exists v\\in U_j\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\in\\operatorname{VPat}_R(v))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Std检查每步以后第一个文本序不右于它的实际收缩；若不存在则条件真空成立。PStd只检查以后第一个位于它上方或同位的实际收缩，允许中间在不交位置有步骤，不能用“只看相邻步”替代。VPat是规则左项的非变量顶点位置，不含变量实例；它与trace原子的typed RPat不同，使用处不混用。此前没有上方收缩时该坐标仍可比较；满足条件的第一次收缩须将坐标纳入其左项模式。它是相对于实际归约的标准性，不断言每步都是当前项的最左外层红项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"38a37d8a0a52c221","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"38a37d8a0a52c221","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统；具体有限路径 $\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 与平行路径 $\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]。$n=\\ell(\\rho)$，$m=L(\\Pi)$，$p_i=\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)$；$\\operatorname{Pos},\\preceq,<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见其上游，子项见 [[56-df-subterm]]。$V$ 为变量集，$\\operatorname{VPat}_R$ 的局部参数为 $u=(p,l,r)\\in\\mathcal E_R$。$J_i(\\rho)$ 仅对 $0\\le i<n$ 定义；$K_{i,u}(\\Pi)$ 仅对 $0\\le i<m$、$u\\in U_i$ 定义。首次指标通过在候选集中量化其最小元素表达，不对空集合调用部分min函数。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定正交系统；具体有限路径 $\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 与平行路径 $\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R$ 见 [[56-df-parallel-labelled-reduction]]。$n=\\ell(\\rho)$，$m=L(\\Pi)$，$p_i=\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)$；$\\operatorname{Pos},\\preceq,<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 见其上游，子项见 [[56-df-subterm]]。$V$ 为变量集，$\\operatorname{VPat}_R$ 的局部参数为 $u=(p,l,r)\\in\\mathcal E_R$。$J_i(\\rho)$ 仅对 $0\\le i<n$ 定义；$K_{i,u}(\\Pi)$ 仅对 $0\\le i<m$、$u\\in U_i$ 定义。首次指标通过在候选集中量化其最小元素表达，不对空集合调用部分min函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho=(\\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol u)\\in\\mathcal F_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol U)\\in\\mathcal P_R","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\ell(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"m=L(\\Pi)","display":false},{"tex":"p_i=\\operatorname{pos}(u_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pos},\\preceq,<_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPat}_R","display":false},{"tex":"u=(p,l,r)\\in\\mathcal E_R","display":false},{"tex":"J_i(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le i<n","display":false},{"tex":"K_{i,u}(\\Pi)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le i<m","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in U_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPat}_R(u)\\coloneqq\\{p\\cdot q:q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(l)\\land l|_q\\notin V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J_i(\\rho)\\coloneqq\\{j:i<j<n\\land(\\operatorname{pos}(u_j)=p_i\\lor\\operatorname{pos}(u_j)<_{\\mathrm{lex}}p_i)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Std}_R(\\rho)\\iff\\forall i<n\\;\\forall j\\in J_i(\\rho)\\;\\bigl((\\forall k\\in J_i(\\rho)\\;(j\\le k))\\Rightarrow p_i\\in\\operatorname{VPat}_R(u_j)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\coloneqq\\{j:i<j<m\\land\\exists v\\in U_j\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(v)\\preceq\\operatorname{pos}(u))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PStd}_R(\\Pi)\\iff\\forall i<m\\;\\forall u\\in U_i\\;\\forall j\\in K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\;\\bigl((\\forall k\\in K_{i,u}(\\Pi)\\;(j\\le k))\\Rightarrow\\exists v\\in U_j\\;(\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\in\\operatorname{VPat}_R(v))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2694,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a65e2eeba9919f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R,\\operatorname{par}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]。"},{"id":"48b61de159797bbe","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$、$n=\\ell(\\rho)$，$\\Pi=\\operatorname{par}_R(\\rho)$。标准性及平行路径区间见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]。$\\operatorname{RPat}_R,\\operatorname{TPos},\\operatorname{Anc}_R$ 见 [[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]、[[56-df-trace-ancestors]]，$\\operatorname{wit}_R$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction.md]]"},{"id":"efe12b141b93e7e9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统。$\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{Std}_R,\\operatorname{PStd}_R$ 见 [[56-df-standard-labelled-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\approx_R$ 分别取 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]] 的具体归约见证与置换等价。有限证明项的归约化见 [[56-lem-proofterm-serialization]]，SR测度及其良基性见 [[56-df-sr-measure]]、[[56-lem-sr-measure-well-founded]]；标准路径的单元素平行化保持标准性见 [[56-lem-standard-implies-parallel-standard]]。"}],"outgoing":["38a37d8a0a52c221","c3157a722a0edf96"]}